{"title":"MathILy-EST","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>MathILy-EST</b> is an 8-week intensive summer research experience for exceptional first-year college students, with entering and second-year college students considered as well. It will take place at Bryn Mawr College,\n</p><p>MathILy-EST provides early research opportunities each year for six college students who are deeply but informally prepared for mathematics research. We provide a stipend of $3600 for students who are chosen for the REU, along with room and board for the duration of the program.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Eligibility\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Eligibility</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Application\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Application</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Topic_and_Director\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Topic and Director</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_Links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External Links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Eligibility\">Eligibility</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathILy-EST&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Eligibility\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>High school students who will be entering college in the fall or students who have already graduated.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Application\">Application</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathILy-EST&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Application\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The application process consists of personal information, two recommendations, information about your mathematical studies, and a multi-question personal statement, all of which must be received by April 2, 2025 for the 2025 REU. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Topic_and_Director\">Topic and Director</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathILy-EST&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Topic and Director\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In 2025 the research topic of MathILy-EST will be the combinatorial representation theory, under the direction of Dr. Joshua Mundinger. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathILy-EST&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: External Links\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.mathily.org/mathilyest/index.html\">Official website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.mathstaircase.org\">Mathematical Staircase, Inc.</a> is the nonprofit organization that runs MathILy-EST.</li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=MathILy-EST&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018094216\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 18/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 274/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.394      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.394      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37323:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018094216 and revision id 288190. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}